   "original_idea": "[IDEA-141] One transfer, start to finish\nCarousel · P1 Product in action\n\nObjective:\nanswers How · Dark theme · when: Week 1 of the corrected plan\n\nHook (EN):\nOne transfer, start to finish.\n\nHook (AR):\nتحويل واحد، من الأول للآخر.\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\nWhat happens after your driver sends one message.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nReal screenshots on the UI-01 phone frame; map slides on BG-58 with the truck and ETA tag.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. One transfer, start to finish.\n2. The driver sends: \"Sent 40 LED strips to Tripoli.\"\n3. Stacko reads it: item, quantity, from, to.\n4. Stock is deducted at the source.\n5. A truck moves on the map with a live countdown.\n6. Tripoli sees the ETA. No calls.\n7. On arrival, the stock lands. Every step has a name and a time.\n\nImages:\nUI-01 · BG-58\n\nConversion mechanic:\nSave + send to a partner\n\nKPI to watch:\nSaves, swipe-through\n\nNotes:\nUse real app screenshots only.\n\nCaption:\nThis is the whole loop. One message in, a clean record out.\nSave it for the next time someone asks \"but how does it work?\"",
