   "original_idea": "[IDEA-144] Questions owners ask us\nCarousel · P1 Product in action\n\nObjective:\nanswers How · Light theme · when: Pin to profile\n\nHook (EN):\nQuestions owners ask us.\n\nHook (AR):\nأسئلة بيسألونا ياها أصحاب المصالح.\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\nStraight answers.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nOne Q&A per slide on frosted glass cards.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. Questions owners ask us.\n2. \"Does my team need training?\" If they can send a message, they can log a move.\n3. \"Does it work in Arabic?\" Yes. Full Arabic interface, right to left.\n4. \"What if someone forgets to log?\" Counts show the mismatch before anyone approves it.\n5. \"Can I follow my imports from China?\" Sea and air, leg by leg, until they land.\n6. \"Do I need GPS on my trucks?\" No. Trucks move on the map by departure time and ETA. GPS comes later.\n7. Ask yours in the comments.\n\nImages:\nBG-59\n\nConversion mechanic:\nComments → answer in Stories\n\nKPI to watch:\nSaves, comments\n\nNotes:\nEvery answer is from the Product Bible.\n\nCaption:\nThe five questions we hear most, answered plainly. What would you ask?",
