   "title": "IDEA-149 · 4 ways phantom stock is created",
   "original_idea": "[IDEA-149] 4 ways phantom stock is created\nCarousel · P2 Pain & cost\n\nObjective:\nanswers Why · Dark theme · when: Any time\n\nHook (EN):\nWhere phantom stock comes from.\n\nHook (AR):\nمن وين بيجي المخزون الوهمي؟\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\n4 everyday causes, and the fix for each.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nCover OB-33; one cause per slide with a small \"Fix\" chip.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. Where phantom stock comes from.\n2. A transfer nobody logged. → Log by message, in 10 seconds.\n3. Receiving without checking against the invoice. → The invoice already created the items.\n4. The wrong item picked and shipped. → Counts flag the mismatch.\n5. Adjustments with no name on them. → Every change has a name and a time.\n\nImages:\nOB-33 · BG-56\n\nConversion mechanic:\nSaves\n\nKPI to watch:\nSaves, swipe-through\n\nCaption:\nPhantom stock isn't theft most of the time. It's small gaps in logging.\nWhich one happens most in your warehouse?",
   "input_source": "csv",
   "source_reference": "Stacko_Instagram_Plan_Review.xlsx › Content › IDEA-149",
   "content_type": "carousel",
