   "title": "IDEA-166 · Why we built Stacko (founder reel)",
   "original_idea": "[IDEA-166] Why we built Stacko (founder reel)\nReel · P4 Proof & trust\n\nObjective:\nanswers Why · Dark theme · when: Launch week\n\nHook (EN):\nWhy we built Stacko.\n\nHook (AR):\nليش بنينا ستاكو؟\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\n45 s: the first client's problem, the idea, the map.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nCover in HTML; b-roll from SC-15 and real screen recordings; Nabih's own voice.\n\nImages:\nSC-15 · screen recording\n\nConversion mechanic:\nSends, profile visits\n\nKPI to watch:\nWatch time, profile visits\n\nNotes:\nUse Nabih's real voice (or his own cloned voice). No AI face presented as the founder.\n\nCaption:\nIt started with one client: three warehouses, monthly imports from China, and no clear picture of the stock. This is what we built.",
   "input_source": "csv",
