   "original_idea": "[IDEA-173] Ramadan and Chinese New Year in the same week\nCarousel · P5 Seasonal & regional\n\nObjective:\nanswers How · Dark theme · when: Post mid-Nov 2026\n\nHook (EN):\nRamadan and Chinese New Year, in the same week.\n\nHook (AR):\nرمضان ورأس السنة الصينية، بنفس الأسبوع.\n\nScene plan:\nSupport line (EN):\nA double squeeze on imports in February 2027.\n\nOn-image elements (HTML layer):\nCover OB-40; a timeline slide on BG-58 with both dates marked.\n\nSlides (carousels):\n1. Ramadan and Chinese New Year, in the same week.\n2. Chinese New Year: 6 February 2027. Factories slow down before it.\n3. Ramadan starts around 8 February.\n4. Sea freight from China: about 30 days, plus customs.\n5. So Ramadan stock has to be produced before the factories close.\n6. Track every container until it lands.\n\nImages:\nOB-40 · BG-58\n\nConversion mechanic:\nSend to your buyer\n\nKPI to watch:\nSends per reach\n\nNotes:\nConfirm the Ramadan start date.\n\nCaption:\nIn 2027 the two dates nearly overlap. If your Ramadan stock comes from China, the real deadline is before the factories close.\nSend this to whoever places your orders.",
